  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81758906a27f94ab58d5f8a30936127b, type: 3}
  m_Name: VanessTuto12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcName: Vaness
  lines:
  - english: Okay, so we've gathered three pieces of evidence? At this point, we'd
      normally know what kind of spirit we're dealing with. But we're going to keep
      going to uncover the rest of the evidence.
    french: "Ok, nous avons r\xE9colt\xE9 3 preuves? \xC0 ce stade normalement, on
      saurait \xE0 quel type d'esprit on a affaire. Mais on va poursuivre pour d\xE9couvrir
      les autres preuves."
  - english: Take this apple and leave it in the room you think is haunted by the
      spirit; it should pique its interest.
    french: "Prend cette pomme et d\xE9pose la dans la pi\xE8ce que tu penses hant\xE9e
      par l'esprit, \xE7a devrait pouvoir l'int\xE9resser."
  - english: I've tweaked this feature; it should work without any issues.
    french: "J'ai truqu\xE9 ce fruit, \xE7a devrait fonctionner sans probl\xE8me."
  letterSoundProfile:
    baseBeep: {fileID: 0}
    minPitch: 1
    maxPitch: 1.2
  voiceType: 0
